OL,3,GNEWSAYour photos: Striking skies and
OL,4,Athe colours of autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe love to feature your photographs
OL,7,Fshowing the beauty of the West Midlands
OL,8,Fin all kinds of ways.
OL,10,FThis week, we have autumnal pumpkins,
OL,11,Fnorthern lights and a busy bee.
OL,13,FYou can be part of future galleries
OL,14,Fwith your own photos of the area -
OL,15,Fupload your images via BBC Weather
OL,16,FWatchers or email us at
OL,17,Fmidlandstoday@bbc.co.uk.
OL,19,FFor inspiration, view some top tips
OL,20,Fhere from three of England's Big
OL,21,FPicture photographers.
